{"id":"ea390338eae06fff","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-provability-interpretation.md","title":"Provability Interpretation","display":"df-provability-interpretation — Provability Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-provability-interpretation","aliases":["89-df-provability-interpretation"],"display":"df-provability-interpretation — Provability Interpretation","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","[[89-df-realization-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-provability-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-provability-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-interpretation — Provability Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a50ebde4b7b3e426\" href=\"?note=a50ebde4b7b3e426\" title=\"89-df-realization-function\">89-df-realization-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is an arithmetical translation.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_T\">\\(\\mathcal R_T\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}\\)</span> are fixed by\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a50ebde4b7b3e426\" href=\"?note=a50ebde4b7b3e426\" title=\"89-df-realization-function\">89-df-realization-function</a> and\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)\\)</span> 是下述定义的实现翻译谓词，翻译参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\mathcal R_T\\;(\\tau=\\tau_{T,r}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\mathcal R_T\\;(\\tau=\\tau_{T,r}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\varphi)\">\\(\\tau(\\varphi)\\)</span> : the arithmetical translation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>复用完整结构递归定义，因而不仅约束 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 分支，也保证命题字母、\n否定和合取分支一致。</li>\n<li>Solovay定理的基础概念</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a> — 算术实现</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a> — 算术解释</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"be68cce492414c6b\" href=\"?note=be68cce492414c6b\" title=\"89-thm-solovay-theorem\">89-thm-solovay-theorem</a> — Solovay定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a> — 可证性谓词</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-realization-function","status":"resolved","id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-realization-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-realization-function","status":"resolved","id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_T$ and $\\tau_{T,r}$ are fixed by\n[[89-df-realization-function]] and\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_T$ and $\\tau_{T,r}$ are fixed by\n[[89-df-realization-function]] and\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]] — 算术实现","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]] — 算术解释","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] — Solovay定理","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]] — 可证性谓词","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{T,r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrInt}_{T}(\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists r\\in\\mathcal R_T\\;(\\tau=\\tau_{T,r}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":1479,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-diamond-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-filtration.md]]\n[[89-df